        "original_id": "fd93f641-7fab-5b0f-8877-aaf4b3a34269",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Indigenous Team of the Century\n- People: Barry Cable, Graham Farmer\n- Sports: Australian rules football, WAFL, VFL\n\nFacts:\n- The Indigenous Team of the Century in Australian rules football was selected to recognise the role of Indigenous Australians in the sport.\n- Barry Cable was born on 22 September 1943.\n- Graham Farmer was named captain of the Indigenous Team of the Century.\n- Barry Cable was selected as coach of the Indigenous Team of the Century.\n- Barry Cable is a former Australian rules footballer and coach.\n- Barry Cable is considered one of the greatest rovers in Australian rules football history.\n- Barry Cable played over 400 senior games in the WAFL and the VFL.\n- Barry Cable later coached in both the WAFL and the VFL.",
